msgstr "订阅源查看器，重新打造"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:359
msgid ""
"It reports format, title, item count and HTTP code, finds the feed when you "
"paste a page, and gives you the real reason a request failed."
msgstr ""
"它会报告格式、标题、条目数和 HTTP 状态码；当你粘贴的是页面时会找出订阅源，并"
"给出请求失败的真正原因。"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:365
msgid "System Status opens instantly"
msgstr "系统状态即时打开"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:366
msgid ""
"The connection test no longer holds the page back, every check says why it "
"is green, amber or red, and the hosting detection knows the big providers."
msgstr ""
"连接测试不再拖慢页面，每项检查都会说明自己为何是绿色、黄色或红色，主机识别也"
"认得主流服务商。"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:375
msgid "The Add-ons page installs the free ones"
msgstr "扩展页面会自行安装免费扩展"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:376
msgid ""
"The free add-ons install with one click, the ones you already have offer "
"Activate, and the memberships are listed at last."
msgstr "免费扩展一键安装，已有的会显示“启用”，会员套餐也终于列了出来。"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:377
msgid "Open the Extensions"
msgstr "打开扩展"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:383
msgid "Campaign Preview for every campaign type"
msgstr "每种采集任务类型都能预览"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:384
msgid ""
"It asks the fetch engine the same question a run does, so it works with "
"every campaign type — Vimeo and the types an add-on registers included."
msgstr ""
"它向采集引擎提出的问题与真实运行完全相同，因此适用于所有采集任务类型——包括 "
"Vimeo 和扩展注册的类型。"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:390
msgid "Updates that never pull the rug"
msgstr "更新绝不会让你措手不及"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:391
msgid ""
"An add-on that falls behind keeps running and updating; only the features "
"that need the new core wait, and a notice says which version puts it right."
msgstr ""
"落后的扩展仍可运行和更新；只有需要新内核的功能才会等待，并有提示说明哪个版本"
"能解决问题。"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:398
msgid "The complete changelog"
msgstr "完整更新日志"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:402
msgid "For the complete list of changes in WPeMatico %s, read the changelog."
msgstr "WPeMatico %s 的完整改动清单，请查看更新日志。"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:407
msgid "See everything new"
msgstr "查看所有新内容"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:418
msgid "Take WPeMatico further"
msgstr "让 WPeMatico 走得更远"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:419
msgid ""
"Add-ons and memberships extend the free plugin: the complete article from "
"the source instead of the RSS snippet, keyword filters, custom titles, "
"translation, AI rewriting, and much more."
msgstr ""
"扩展和会员套餐让这个免费插件更进一步：从来源获取全文而不只是 RSS 摘要、关键词"
"筛选、自定义标题、翻译、AI 改写等等。"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:420
msgid ""
"The new Dashboard shows the main ones as cards, so you can see what an add-"
"on would switch on before you get it."
msgstr "新的仪表板把主要扩展做成卡片，让你在购买前就能看到某个扩展会开启什么。"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:422
msgid "WPeMatico Starter Memberships"
msgstr "WPeMatico Starter 会员套餐"

#: includes/lib/welcome.php:423
