#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:125
msgid "Successfully migrated %d campaigns."
msgstr "已成功迁移 %d 个采集任务。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:343
#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:261
msgid "Import keyword filters"
msgstr "导入关键词筛选"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:344
msgid "Maps Feedzy include/exclude keywords to WPeMatico keyword filters."
msgstr "把 Feedzy 的包含/排除关键词映射为 WPeMatico 的关键词筛选。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:348
#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:266
msgid ""
"<strong>Keyword Filtering was enabled in the WPeMatico Professional "
"settings</strong> so the imported filters run."
msgstr ""
"<strong>已在 WPeMatico Professional 设置中启用关键词筛选</strong>，以便导入的"
"筛选规则生效。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:351
#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:269
msgid "Import fallback featured image"
msgstr "导入备用特色图片"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:352
msgid "Uses Feedzy's default thumbnail as the campaign default featured image."
msgstr "把 Feedzy 的默认缩略图用作采集任务的默认特色图片。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:358
msgid "Import auto-translation"
msgstr "导入自动翻译"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:359
msgid "Recreates Feedzy auto-translation with the Polyglot addon."
msgstr "用 Polyglot 扩展重建 Feedzy 的自动翻译。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:363
msgid ""
"WPeMatico <strong>Polyglot needs its translation API configured in Settings</"
"strong> for the imported campaigns to translate."
msgstr ""
"要让导入的采集任务进行翻译，WPeMatico <strong>Polyglot 需要在设置中配置好翻"
"译 API</strong>。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:366
#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:283
msgid "Import content rewrite"
msgstr "导入内容改写"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:367
msgid "Recreates Feedzy content rewrite with the GPT Spinner addon."
msgstr "用 GPT Spinner 扩展重建 Feedzy 的内容改写。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:371
msgid ""
"WPeMatico <strong>GPT Spinner needs its API configured in Settings</strong>. "
"Check the model: Etruel Rewriter for SpinnerChief/WordAI, GPT Machine for "
"ChatGPT."
msgstr ""
"WPeMatico <strong>GPT Spinner 需要在设置中配置好 API</strong>。注意模型："
"SpinnerChief/WordAI 用 Etruel Rewriter，ChatGPT 用 GPT Machine。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:462
msgid "Feed %1$d of %2$d"
msgstr "第 %1$d 个订阅源，共 %2$d 个"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:465
#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:1044
msgid "(imported)"
msgstr "（已导入）"

#. translators: %s: import date/time.
#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-feedzy-rss-feeds.php:470
msgid "Imported from Feedzy on %s"
msgstr "于 %s 从 Feedzy 导入"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:1043
msgid "Imported feed"
msgstr "已导入的订阅源"

#. translators: %s: import date/time.
#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:1055
msgid "Imported from WP RSS Aggregator on %s"
msgstr "于 %s 从 WP RSS Aggregator 导入"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:116
msgid "No feed sources found to migrate."
msgstr "未找到可迁移的订阅源。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:1219
msgid ""
"WP RSS Aggregator feeds are still in the old (v4) format. Open WP RSS "
"Aggregator and let it migrate your feeds to v5 first, then run this "
"migration."
msgstr ""
"WP RSS Aggregator 的订阅源仍是旧的（v4）格式。请先打开 WP RSS Aggregator，让"
"它把订阅源迁移到 v5，然后再执行本次迁移。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:1221
msgid "No WP RSS Aggregator feed sources found."
msgstr "未找到 WP RSS Aggregator 的订阅源。"

#. translators: %d: number of skipped display-only feeds.
#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:131
msgid ""
"Skipped %d display-only feed: install the WPeMatico RSS Feed Reader addon "
"and run the migration again to import it."
msgid_plural ""
"Skipped %d display-only feeds: install the WPeMatico RSS Feed Reader addon "
"and run the migration again to import them."
msgstr[0] ""
"已跳过 %d 个仅用于展示的订阅源：请安装 WPeMatico RSS Feed Reader 扩展，然后重"
"新运行迁移以导入它们。"

#. translators: %d: number of campaigns imported deactivated.
#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:144
msgid ""
"%d feed that was running in WP RSS Aggregator became a campaign that "
"<strong>creates posts</strong>, so it was imported deactivated. Review it "
"and activate its scheduling when you are ready."
msgid_plural ""
"%d feeds that were running in WP RSS Aggregator became campaigns that "
"<strong>create posts</strong>, so they were imported deactivated. Review "
"them and activate their scheduling when you are ready."
msgstr[0] ""
"原本在 WP RSS Aggregator 中运行的 %d 个订阅源变成了会<strong>创建文章</"
"strong>的采集任务，因此导入后处于停用状态。请检查它们，准备好后再启用其计划。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:262
msgid ""
"Maps WP RSS Aggregator import automations to WPeMatico include/exclude "
"keyword filters."
msgstr ""
"把 WP RSS Aggregator 的导入自动化映射为 WPeMatico 的包含/排除关键词筛选。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:270
msgid ""
"Uses the source's fallback featured image as the campaign default featured "
"image."
msgstr "把来源的备用特色图片用作采集任务的默认特色图片。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:276
msgid "Import full content from truncated feeds"
msgstr "从截断的订阅源导入全文"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:277
msgid ""
"Recreates WP RSS Aggregator's full-text import with the WPeMatico Full "
"Content addon."
msgstr "用 WPeMatico Full Content 扩展重建 WP RSS Aggregator 的全文导入。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:284
msgid ""
"Recreates WP RSS Aggregator's spin/AI rewrite with the WPeMatico GPT Spinner "
"addon."
msgstr "用 WPeMatico GPT Spinner 扩展重建 WP RSS Aggregator 的伪原创/AI 改写。"

#: includes/migration/importers/class-migrator-wp-rss-aggregator.php:288
msgid ""
"WPeMatico <strong>GPT Spinner needs its API configured in Settings</strong>. "
"Check the model: Etruel Rewriter for SpinnerChief/WordAI, GPT Machine for "
"the AI engine."
msgstr ""
"WPeMatico <strong>GPT Spinner 需要在设置中配置好 API</strong>。注意模型："
"SpinnerChief/WordAI 用 Etruel Rewriter，AI 引擎用 GPT Machine。"

