#: includes/settings/page.php:421
msgid "SimplePie Settings"
msgstr "SimplePie 设置"

#: includes/settings/page.php:463
msgid "Advanced Fetching"
msgstr "高级采集"

#: includes/settings/page.php:472
msgid ""
"Dangerous: the content is stored exactly as the feed sends it, scripts "
"included."
msgstr "危险：正文会按订阅源发来的原样保存，脚本也一并保留。"

